flowchart TD
 A([Start]) --> B[Browse menu and add items]
 B --> C[Validate cart and availability]
 C --> D{Cart valid?}
 D -- No --> E[Show error and revise cart]
 E --> B
 D -- Yes --> F[Enter address and checkout]
 F --> G[Authenticate and confirm]
 G --> H[Recalculate trusted prices]
 H --> I[Persist order, items and status event]
 I --> J[Confirmation and tracking]
